<title>USA: Leather Factory names financial chief.</title>
<headline>Leather Factory names financial chief.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leather Factory Inc said on Thursday that it named Fred Howell chief financial officer, treasurer and a member of the board of directors.</p>
<p>Most recently, Howell served as vice president of planning at Leather Factory, a wholesale distributor of leather goods.</p>
<p>Howell succeeds John Tittle, who left the company to join the corporate finance, recovery and disputes section of Price Waterhouse LLP in Fort Worth.</p>
</text>
